<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feature">
      <div>
        <h2>What a retreat looks like</h2>
        <p>Days begin gently — a walk, breath work, a quiet meal. Mornings are for learning: short, clear sessions on nutrition, sleep, stress, ageing and reversal. Afternoons are for cooking, kitchen practice and personal consultations. Evenings are for community, music, and time outside.</p>
        <p>Retreats are typically held over four to seven days at locations chosen for clean air, simple food, and proximity to nature.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="visual" data-label="A SHARAN retreat morning"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

